WEBVTT

00:31.130 --> 00:33.330
[You Have My Heart]

00:33.380 --> 00:36.320
[Episode 2
The Echo Demon Strikes]

00:57.490 --> 00:59.130
Master, are you alright?

01:03.640 --> 01:06.640
Why doesn't it work
even when he cuts out his own heart?

01:08.500 --> 01:09.360
Don't kill him.

01:10.740 --> 01:11.350
Look.

01:33.360 --> 01:35.090
Master, his spiritual power--

01:36.350 --> 01:38.150
it's flowing toward your heart.

01:39.830 --> 01:40.830
He cuts his heart,

01:41.780 --> 01:42.780
and I suffer.

01:43.710 --> 01:44.440
It seems that

01:45.229 --> 01:48.150
although this half of my heart has been
parted from me for a century,

01:48.150 --> 01:49.830
we were once one.

01:50.340 --> 01:51.430
The bond remains.

01:52.580 --> 01:54.110
If anything happens to him,

01:54.430 --> 01:55.950
this half within me

01:56.580 --> 01:58.460
would likely be shattered.

02:01.580 --> 02:02.510
Unless

02:03.950 --> 02:05.750
he cuts out his heart willingly.

03:16.990 --> 03:17.780
I'm not dead.

03:18.060 --> 03:18.920
What happened?

03:19.950 --> 03:20.780
You're awake.

03:22.550 --> 03:23.340
Who are you?

03:25.190 --> 03:26.310
Chen Xiaohu,

03:27.579 --> 03:30.310
the one and only constable
in Yin-Yang Crossing.

03:35.780 --> 03:36.579
Constable?

03:40.900 --> 03:41.710
Well, in Yin-Yang Crossing,

03:41.710 --> 03:43.150
public order is exceptionally good now,

03:43.150 --> 03:45.340
so there's really nothing
for a constable like me to do.

03:45.340 --> 03:48.800
My daily duties mainly involve
compiling the county records,

03:48.950 --> 03:50.950
and painting portraits for Lady Fufeng,

03:50.950 --> 03:53.510
which is also a major part
of my daily work.

04:00.380 --> 04:01.110
As for you,

04:02.150 --> 04:04.510
you barely arrived
and got thrown in here by Lady Fufeng.

04:04.510 --> 04:05.770
How did you offend her?

04:06.700 --> 04:09.900
I am Bai Shanjun,
the newly appointed county magistrate.

04:11.070 --> 04:12.710
So you are the magistrate.

04:14.160 --> 04:17.690
There hasn't been a magistrate
in Yin-Yang Crossing for years.

04:18.390 --> 04:20.220
Did you offend someone at court?

04:20.779 --> 04:22.640
Why were you exiled to this place?

04:23.420 --> 04:24.820
Is this the county yamen?

04:26.540 --> 04:28.220
This is Xiqian.

04:31.260 --> 04:32.350
This is Xiqianhua.

04:33.790 --> 04:34.760
Xiqianhua?

04:35.520 --> 04:38.320
Why is the county yamen located
inside Xiqianhua?

04:39.710 --> 04:40.190
Come on.

04:40.630 --> 04:41.190
Bro.

04:41.540 --> 04:43.020
Didn't you ask your predecessors

04:43.020 --> 04:44.150
before coming here?

04:44.750 --> 04:46.780
There has been no law
in Yin-Yang Crossing for a long time,

04:46.780 --> 04:48.630
let alone a county yamen.

04:48.780 --> 04:49.490
We

04:49.510 --> 04:51.100
all work for Lady Fufeng.

04:51.130 --> 04:54.400
Lady Fufeng is the eternal master
of Yin-Yang Crossing.

04:54.750 --> 04:55.390
I know.

04:55.830 --> 04:56.659
I came here

04:56.659 --> 04:58.220
just to idle my days away.

04:58.659 --> 04:59.580
I didn't expect

04:59.580 --> 05:01.100
to offend someone right after arriving.

05:01.100 --> 05:02.300
Now they want me dead.

05:02.870 --> 05:05.630
Had I known taking this post
would cost me my life,

05:05.900 --> 05:08.340
I would have resigned
and headed home to rest.

05:08.340 --> 05:09.470
Whatever you think,

05:09.830 --> 05:10.750
take my advice:

05:11.150 --> 05:12.540
This isn't a place you or I can control,

05:12.540 --> 05:13.670
even if we wanted to.

05:13.830 --> 05:14.950
Beneath your feet lies a borderland

05:14.950 --> 05:16.950
where the living, the dead,
and spirits,

05:16.950 --> 05:18.870
along with countless unknown things,

05:18.870 --> 05:20.020
all live together.

05:20.190 --> 05:21.220
What borderland?

05:21.550 --> 05:24.100
All I see is a bunch of charlatans
playing ghosts,

05:24.100 --> 05:27.430
and a flock of gullible fools
who can be manipulated at will.

05:27.710 --> 05:28.270
I know.

05:28.270 --> 05:30.200
Every place has its own ecosystem.

05:30.420 --> 05:32.880
I have no intention
of disrupting it rashly.

05:33.070 --> 05:34.190
Once my time is up

05:34.190 --> 05:35.070
and my term ends,

05:35.070 --> 05:36.220
I will leave here.

05:37.220 --> 05:39.150
It's only been six months
since I passed the imperial exams.

05:39.150 --> 05:41.610
I'm not wasting my life
in this cursed place.

05:45.340 --> 05:46.940
It can't even be wiped clean.

05:47.780 --> 05:50.980
Master, I find this man very strange.

05:51.580 --> 05:52.659
What's strange?

05:52.810 --> 05:55.770
He clearly bears half your heart
within him,

05:56.150 --> 05:58.710
yet seems completely unaware of its power.

05:59.020 --> 06:01.220
He possesses earth-shattering power,

06:01.220 --> 06:04.220
but speaks like the most stubborn mortal.

06:05.390 --> 06:06.630
Most importantly,

06:06.870 --> 06:08.200
he looks so much like...

06:18.750 --> 06:19.780
Why is it so dirty?

06:25.950 --> 06:27.680
You sure have adapted quickly.

06:27.780 --> 06:30.100
Take things as they come.

06:30.420 --> 06:31.980
It's quite nice to be this carefree.

06:31.980 --> 06:33.909
My salary keeps rolling in anyway.

06:34.540 --> 06:35.830
Now you're getting it, bro!

06:35.830 --> 06:36.710
Let me tell you,

06:36.710 --> 06:37.900
that's the right attitude.

06:37.900 --> 06:38.950
Even if the sky falls,

06:38.950 --> 06:40.680
Lady Fufeng will be there to hold it up.

06:40.680 --> 06:41.340
Otherwise,

06:43.270 --> 06:44.980
just that echo demon recently

06:45.000 --> 06:46.510
would be enough to give you a hard time.

06:46.510 --> 06:47.390
Echo demon?

06:47.950 --> 06:49.870
Echo demon.

06:53.659 --> 06:56.659
Did you really hear
Lady Fufeng's statue speak?

06:57.020 --> 06:58.390
Probably just the wind blowing the wood.

06:58.390 --> 06:59.830
You must be hard of hearing
to have missed it.

06:59.830 --> 07:02.430
I heard it clearly from my room
after midnight.

07:17.150 --> 07:18.540
Isn't that normal?

07:19.100 --> 07:20.100
Nonsense.

07:28.460 --> 07:29.980
Why does it smell so bad?

07:30.950 --> 07:32.220
What is that smell?

07:33.270 --> 07:35.020
Did the offerings go bad?

07:44.820 --> 07:47.080
The smell is coming from under the table.

08:00.070 --> 08:01.000
Someone's dead!

08:02.020 --> 08:02.950
Someone's dead!

08:04.190 --> 08:05.620
I'll strangle you.

08:05.900 --> 08:08.330
Scream again, and I'll strangle you.

08:09.180 --> 08:10.150
Who's talking?

08:12.940 --> 08:13.900
Who's talking?

08:14.230 --> 08:15.750
Who... Who's talking?

08:16.440 --> 08:17.750
Who's talking?

08:18.780 --> 08:20.150
Who's talking?

08:21.460 --> 08:22.910
Who's talking?

08:24.110 --> 08:25.510
Who's talking?

08:27.270 --> 08:28.420
Who's talking?

08:29.910 --> 08:30.700
Wait for me.

08:30.990 --> 08:32.059
Don't go so fast!

08:32.659 --> 08:33.320
Wait for me.

08:34.659 --> 08:35.320
Wait for me.

08:35.870 --> 08:36.870
Wait for me.

09:15.950 --> 09:17.750
W-what is that noise?

09:18.900 --> 09:20.900
Someone is beating the willow drum.

09:21.630 --> 09:22.990
Five strikes of the drum

09:23.400 --> 09:25.260
means that a murder has occurred.

09:26.440 --> 09:27.200
A murder?

09:28.130 --> 09:29.280
Whatever case it is,

09:29.380 --> 09:30.910
it has nothing to do with us.

09:31.450 --> 09:33.140
Lady Fufeng will handle it.

10:08.160 --> 10:09.560
Greetings, Lady Fufeng.

10:11.560 --> 10:12.720
Bootlicker.

10:15.720 --> 10:16.720
You two,

10:17.300 --> 10:18.110
come with me.

10:21.410 --> 10:24.580
[Fufeng's Mansion]

10:27.630 --> 10:28.390
Lady Fufeng.

10:28.750 --> 10:29.540
Lady Fufeng.

10:42.190 --> 10:43.190
No evil power.

10:46.460 --> 10:48.220
No demonic aura either.

10:49.450 --> 10:50.170
Master,

10:50.300 --> 10:52.410
the identity of the corpse
has been confirmed.

10:52.410 --> 10:54.100
It's Widow Liu from Shi Village.

10:54.100 --> 10:55.360
Looking at the corpse,

10:55.370 --> 10:56.930
there are bruises on the neck.

10:56.930 --> 10:58.190
It was done by a mortal.

11:01.460 --> 11:02.790
Why don't you take a look

11:03.400 --> 11:05.060
and figure out what happened?

11:06.110 --> 11:06.990
Me?

11:07.440 --> 11:09.500
I... I don't think that's necessary.

11:09.520 --> 11:11.080
It's better left to Lady Fufeng...

11:11.080 --> 11:13.190
I forgot to introduce him to everyone.

11:13.190 --> 11:15.450
This is our new county magistrate
of Yin-Yang Crossing.

11:15.450 --> 11:16.410
Bai Shanjun.

11:16.600 --> 11:17.550
Lord Bai.

11:17.580 --> 11:20.470
He is the new magistrate.
The new magistrate.

11:20.490 --> 11:21.320
Lord Bai.

11:22.810 --> 11:25.420
We haven't had a magistrate here
for a long time.

11:25.420 --> 11:27.150
You are the head of this county.

11:27.460 --> 11:28.720
You should take a look.

11:42.760 --> 11:45.120
Just as that lady said earlier,

11:45.590 --> 11:48.230
the victim was strangled from behind,

11:48.580 --> 11:49.610
which caused her death.

11:49.610 --> 11:51.210
This is a mortal murder case.

11:52.350 --> 11:54.280
Are you sure this is a mortal murder

11:54.500 --> 11:56.230
and not the work of evil demons?

11:57.320 --> 11:58.520
The cause is unclear,

11:58.560 --> 11:59.690
so I dare not jump to conclusions.

11:59.690 --> 12:01.790
But I believe there are no demons
in this world,

12:01.790 --> 12:04.750
only people causing mischief
in their guise.

12:09.020 --> 12:11.220
How can this magistrate be so ignorant?

12:11.350 --> 12:14.440
The cause is unclear,
so I dare not jump to conclusions.

12:14.890 --> 12:17.230
But I believe there are no demons
in this world,

12:17.230 --> 12:20.930
only people causing mischief
in their guise.

12:20.960 --> 12:22.090
Who is mimicking me?

12:22.150 --> 12:23.630
Who is mimicking me?

12:24.050 --> 12:25.830
Causing mischief in their guise.

12:25.830 --> 12:26.900
Who is mimicking me?

12:26.900 --> 12:28.180
Who is mimicking me?

12:28.740 --> 12:29.860
I'll strangle you.

12:30.460 --> 12:32.520
Scream again, and I'll strangle you.

12:33.490 --> 12:34.200
I'll strangle you.

12:34.200 --> 12:34.890
My Lord... My...

12:34.890 --> 12:36.300
This... This is the echo demon.

12:36.300 --> 12:37.020
Scream again, and I'll strangle you.

12:37.020 --> 12:37.990
Echo demon.

12:38.590 --> 12:39.870
Scream again, and I'll strangle you.

12:39.870 --> 12:40.580
Don't panic, everyone!

12:40.580 --> 12:41.700
I haven't finished my painting yet.

12:41.700 --> 12:43.020
Lady Fufeng is here with us.

12:43.020 --> 12:44.620
What's there to panic about?

12:48.070 --> 12:50.420
With Lady Fufeng here,
what is there to fear?

12:50.420 --> 12:51.580
Right, right.

12:51.760 --> 12:53.110
I am a bit tired today.

12:53.790 --> 12:55.450
Since Magistrate Bai is here,

12:55.810 --> 12:57.580
let's leave the investigation to him.

12:57.580 --> 12:58.180
This...

12:59.600 --> 13:00.360
Lady Fufeng,

13:00.610 --> 13:01.900
absolutely not!

13:02.090 --> 13:04.170
Please, Lady Fufeng, take charge!

13:04.680 --> 13:05.400
Yes.

13:05.400 --> 13:06.200
Yes, My Lady.

13:06.200 --> 13:07.570
This echo demon is committing crimes,

13:07.570 --> 13:09.160
and we outsiders can’t handle it.

13:09.160 --> 13:09.800
Please...

13:09.800 --> 13:11.080
Please use Xiqianhua.

13:11.080 --> 13:11.990
Lady Fufeng,

13:12.290 --> 13:13.970
the people are terrified.

13:14.470 --> 13:16.230
They all believe this is demon work.

13:16.230 --> 13:17.160
Following the usual practice,

13:17.160 --> 13:20.040
it's best left to you to handle.

13:20.510 --> 13:21.320
Exactly.

13:21.680 --> 13:22.630
Lady Fufeng,

13:22.890 --> 13:24.040
the people trust you.

13:24.040 --> 13:25.930
You should give them an explanation

13:25.930 --> 13:27.320
to put their minds at ease.

13:27.320 --> 13:28.590
I just arrived at Yin-Yang Crossing.

13:28.590 --> 13:30.080
I'm still unfamiliar with the ropes.

13:30.080 --> 13:32.630
Yin-Yang Crossing has its own laws
and rules.

13:32.940 --> 13:34.200
Having me investigate the case

13:34.200 --> 13:36.200
would be nothing but a waste of time.

13:39.960 --> 13:40.870
Lord Bai,

13:41.800 --> 13:44.060
you sure know how to adapt to situations.

13:46.630 --> 13:48.560
Yin-Yang Crossing can be special,

13:48.630 --> 13:50.030
but it cannot be lawless.

13:51.510 --> 13:52.800
If the case is yours,

13:52.800 --> 13:54.130
there's no escaping it.

13:54.510 --> 13:55.920
How about we make a bet?

13:56.990 --> 13:58.450
I won't touch this corpse.

13:58.830 --> 14:00.560
You can search the ancestral hall
as you please.

14:00.560 --> 14:02.080
The village is under your control.

14:02.080 --> 14:03.410
Everything is up to you.

14:03.560 --> 14:05.160
If you find the real culprit,

14:05.350 --> 14:07.350
I will personally
write a recommendation letter

14:07.350 --> 14:09.080
to send you back to the capital.

14:10.750 --> 14:11.560
But

14:12.160 --> 14:13.680
if within three days,

14:13.800 --> 14:15.350
you fail to find the real culprit,

14:15.350 --> 14:17.150
whether they be mortal or demon.

14:17.510 --> 14:18.080
Then

14:19.280 --> 14:21.410
you shall end your own life on the spot,

14:23.960 --> 14:26.670
and cut out your heart for me.

14:27.560 --> 14:28.420
How about that?

14:35.040 --> 14:35.830
My Lady.

14:36.800 --> 14:39.130
Are you asking me to investigate the case,

14:39.400 --> 14:41.080
or do you simply want me dead?

14:43.800 --> 14:45.230
I just want to see

14:46.510 --> 14:47.590
what you will do.

14:50.440 --> 14:51.560
What can I do?

14:51.800 --> 14:53.960
I studied so hard
to pass the imperial exams,

14:53.960 --> 14:56.830
only to be assigned
to an incompetent noble's son.

14:56.830 --> 14:58.920
I had to take the blame for everything.

14:58.920 --> 15:00.320
With no way to appeal,

15:00.590 --> 15:02.400
his father plotted against me

15:02.710 --> 15:03.400
and had me dispatched to this

15:03.400 --> 15:05.200
godforsaken, monstrous place!

15:05.350 --> 15:07.200
Fine. I accept it.

15:07.350 --> 15:09.110
You rule this place.

15:09.200 --> 15:10.990
I never wanted to overstep my bounds.

15:10.990 --> 15:12.990
But you tried to kill me time and again.

15:12.990 --> 15:14.200
Kill me if you want,

15:14.230 --> 15:15.560
but forcing me to take my own life?

15:15.560 --> 15:16.760
Do you even have to decide

15:16.760 --> 15:18.190
how I should die?

15:19.800 --> 15:20.710
Lord Bai,

15:21.350 --> 15:22.560
calm yourself.

15:23.400 --> 15:24.200
This bet is not

15:24.200 --> 15:25.350
a bad deal for you.

15:25.830 --> 15:26.960
My recommendation letter

15:26.960 --> 15:29.440
carries weight with your emperor.

15:42.510 --> 15:43.960
Do I have a choice?

15:58.470 --> 16:00.320
Fine. I accept.

16:15.800 --> 16:19.130
The victim has distinct
four-finger bruises on the throat.

16:20.060 --> 16:21.440
Her hyoid bone is dislocated.

16:21.440 --> 16:24.640
There is internal bleeding and fluid
in the chest cavity.

16:24.750 --> 16:25.870
The joints are stiff.

16:25.870 --> 16:28.200
There are overlapping scratches
on the back of the hand

16:28.200 --> 16:30.600
with blood and dirt
under the fingernails.

16:33.960 --> 16:36.760
But why are there oil stains on the wound?

16:40.200 --> 16:41.130
Help!

16:41.290 --> 16:42.180
Help!

16:53.510 --> 16:54.230
In short,

16:54.230 --> 16:55.790
the victim struggled violently

16:55.790 --> 16:57.030
before her death.

16:57.750 --> 16:58.880
It was not an accidental death,

16:58.880 --> 17:00.410
nor was it caused by demons.

17:00.510 --> 17:03.370
Instead, she was strangled to death
by human hands.

17:03.390 --> 17:06.680
The priority is to find the real culprit
as soon as possible.

17:06.680 --> 17:07.960
Strangled to death?

17:08.030 --> 17:09.839
But we clearly heard

17:09.839 --> 17:11.569
the statue talking yesterday.

17:12.230 --> 17:12.710
Yeah.

17:12.710 --> 17:13.359
My Lord.

17:13.359 --> 17:13.920
Exactly. I heard it just now too.

17:13.920 --> 17:15.450
Didn't you hear it just now?

17:15.450 --> 17:17.140
That ''strangle you'' part.

17:17.160 --> 17:19.619
Right.
Wasn't Widow Liu strangled to death?

17:33.140 --> 17:33.790
Stop!

17:34.470 --> 17:36.470
How dare you smash Lady Fufeng's statue!

17:36.470 --> 17:37.510
Do you want to die?

17:50.790 --> 17:51.600
Wh-wha-?

17:52.720 --> 17:54.330
What is going on here?

17:56.840 --> 17:57.310
This...

17:57.600 --> 17:58.310
Come for me.

17:58.680 --> 17:59.540
Leave it alone.

18:05.310 --> 18:05.990
Hold court!

18:14.030 --> 18:15.120
What's your name?

18:15.120 --> 18:16.120
Where do you live?

18:16.360 --> 18:17.960
The villagers call me Shuan.

18:18.600 --> 18:19.930
My parents passed away.

18:20.030 --> 18:22.120
I've been living in the ruined temple
outside the village.

18:22.120 --> 18:23.960
Ruined temple! Ruined temple!

18:24.170 --> 18:25.280
While at the ancestral hall,

18:25.280 --> 18:26.940
did you see any strange people

18:26.990 --> 18:28.190
or anything unusual?

18:28.470 --> 18:29.400
I don't know.

18:29.920 --> 18:31.250
I was starving so badly,

18:31.360 --> 18:33.550
so I taught the parrot
to mimic human speech

18:33.550 --> 18:35.550
to fake a demon just to get some food.

18:35.960 --> 18:37.790
I didn't mean to really scare anyone.

18:37.790 --> 18:39.390
You still shouldn't do that.

18:39.750 --> 18:40.990
Are you the village chief?

18:40.990 --> 18:41.790
No.

18:42.840 --> 18:43.960
The village chief isn't here,

18:43.960 --> 18:45.830
so I'm acting on his behalf.

18:46.030 --> 18:47.570
I am Shi Quan,

18:47.840 --> 18:50.370
the deputy magistrate
of Yin-Yang Crossing.

18:51.070 --> 18:51.920
Last night,

18:52.440 --> 18:54.510
did any of you hear what this parrot said?

18:54.510 --> 18:55.550
I did.

18:55.550 --> 18:57.070
It said, "Don't scream. Don't scream."

18:57.070 --> 18:59.400
''Scream again, and I'll strangle you.''

19:02.710 --> 19:04.400
Don't scream! Don't scream!

19:04.470 --> 19:06.710
Scream again, and I'll strangle you.

19:10.880 --> 19:12.880
That's Village Chief Zhou's voice.

19:13.470 --> 19:14.380
I've long heard

19:14.400 --> 19:17.790
that the village chief has had his eye
on Widow Liu for a long time.

19:17.790 --> 19:18.840
No wonder.

19:19.360 --> 19:22.360
Village Chief Zhou hasn't been seen
for three days.

19:23.600 --> 19:24.440
Deputy Magistrate Shi,

19:24.440 --> 19:25.880
start a search immediately.

19:25.880 --> 19:26.480
Yes.

19:26.710 --> 19:27.510
My Lord,

19:28.120 --> 19:29.550
I'm a civil official.

19:31.960 --> 19:33.290
Aren't you a constable?

19:33.660 --> 19:34.460
I...

19:35.310 --> 19:37.280
I haven't arrested anyone in a long time.

19:37.280 --> 19:38.360
Arrest! Arrest!

19:41.030 --> 19:44.960
Whispers echo in the forest,
each cry like weeping.

19:45.400 --> 19:49.470
Mimicking human speech,
it drains away vitality.

19:49.840 --> 19:53.750
Old things return,
shifting within the heart.

19:53.960 --> 19:58.680
Not their rightful owner—
calamity will not cease.

20:02.050 --> 20:02.700
Shuan.

20:03.340 --> 20:05.790
Did you ever teach this parrot
to sing nursery rhymes?

20:05.790 --> 20:07.650
I taught it to mimic human speech,

20:07.720 --> 20:09.330
but not any nursery rhymes.

20:10.000 --> 20:10.930
Nursery rhymes?

20:11.710 --> 20:14.110
The children have been chanting it lately.

20:14.270 --> 20:16.330
At the wine merchant's murder scene,

20:16.550 --> 20:18.070
someone also heard it.

20:20.340 --> 20:21.210
Lady Fufeng,

20:23.920 --> 20:25.530
The money in the house
of Village Chief Zhou Ming

20:25.530 --> 20:26.430
has long been gone.

20:26.430 --> 20:28.400
I'm afraid he has already absconded.

20:28.400 --> 20:30.660
Zhou Ming must be arrested immediately.

20:30.710 --> 20:32.680
This case cannot be looked at
in isolation.

20:32.680 --> 20:33.960
The wine merchant's sudden death

20:33.960 --> 20:35.740
and Widow Liu's case in the ancestral hall

20:35.740 --> 20:37.010
both connect to the rumor of echo demon

20:37.010 --> 20:38.510
and the eerie nursery rhyme.

20:38.510 --> 20:39.640
These two cases

20:39.990 --> 20:41.920
should be investigated together.

20:42.880 --> 20:44.750
You aim quite high, Lord Bai.

20:45.040 --> 20:46.390
With only three days

20:46.990 --> 20:48.750
and so much on your plate,

20:49.550 --> 20:51.710
be careful you cannot wrap things up.

20:55.000 --> 20:55.550
My Lady.

20:56.890 --> 20:58.490
Whether I can wrap things up,

20:58.700 --> 20:59.940
is that up to me?

21:01.920 --> 21:03.200
You want me dead,

21:03.920 --> 21:04.960
but I want to live.

21:07.960 --> 21:08.920
As you wish.

21:10.310 --> 21:11.160
However,

21:11.880 --> 21:13.160
I also have a request.

21:15.490 --> 21:16.600
It comes with me.

21:17.470 --> 21:18.360
Following you,

21:18.510 --> 21:20.200
who knows what kind of trouble
it will cause.

21:20.200 --> 21:20.920
My Lady.

21:21.070 --> 21:22.290
It is important physical evidence

21:22.290 --> 21:24.090
and should be kept in my custody.

21:26.360 --> 21:27.200
Fine then.

21:47.200 --> 21:48.330
The bird's gone.

21:48.950 --> 21:49.800
It seems

21:50.510 --> 21:52.360
Lord Bai is not very lucky.

21:53.400 --> 21:56.010
Now you've lost your last bargaining chip.

21:56.750 --> 21:59.420
You'd better just look
for Village Chief Zhou.

21:59.890 --> 22:01.420
There's not much time left.

22:30.490 --> 22:31.970
Revealing your demon form

22:32.100 --> 22:34.330
and disrupting the order
of the human world,

22:34.330 --> 22:37.050
have you forgotten the rules of Xiqianhua?

22:37.570 --> 22:38.700
Forgive me, My Lady.

22:39.050 --> 22:40.610
It's not that I forgot,

22:40.850 --> 22:41.920
but that child,

22:42.130 --> 22:44.200
Shuan, he was good to me.

22:44.810 --> 22:46.410
I wanted to get him some food.

22:48.610 --> 22:50.070
The day I hid in the statue,

22:50.810 --> 22:51.880
I heard something.

22:55.440 --> 22:56.700
V-Village Chief Zhou.

23:00.200 --> 23:01.090
Good lady,

23:02.010 --> 23:03.940
you must be lonely all by yourself.

23:04.050 --> 23:06.480
Why don't you just give in to me?

23:07.610 --> 23:08.270
Don't move.

23:09.200 --> 23:09.850
Come here.

23:09.850 --> 23:11.160
Help! Help!

23:11.160 --> 23:12.640
Don't scream! Don't scream!

23:12.640 --> 23:13.240
Help!

23:13.400 --> 23:14.960
Scream again, and I'll strangle you.

23:14.960 --> 23:17.200
I didn't want to reveal myself
and cause panic,

23:17.200 --> 23:18.810
so I mimicked his voice,

23:18.980 --> 23:20.140
the village chief's voice

23:20.140 --> 23:21.060
to scare them,

23:21.090 --> 23:22.810
so that the corpse would be found sooner.

23:22.810 --> 23:24.960
The wine merchant's case a few days ago,

23:24.960 --> 23:26.160
was it related to you?

23:26.570 --> 23:27.240
No... no.

23:27.240 --> 23:28.050
It wasn't.

23:28.240 --> 23:30.440
Shuan and I have never left the village.

23:30.570 --> 23:32.640
I just heard that nursery rhyme around.

23:32.640 --> 23:34.700
I... I really haven't harmed anyone.

23:35.630 --> 23:38.260
Alright, go rest now.

23:51.010 --> 23:53.410
Whispers echo in the forest,

23:53.530 --> 23:55.810
each cry like weeping.

23:56.010 --> 23:58.010
Mimicking human speech,

23:58.480 --> 24:00.400
it drains away vitality.

24:00.810 --> 24:02.810
Old things return,

24:03.090 --> 24:05.050
shifting within the heart.

24:05.570 --> 24:07.530
Not their rightful owner—

24:08.090 --> 24:10.050
calamity will not cease.
